WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.770
-Over the past several weeks,
Kanye West has expressed

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.072
controversial opinions
about racism in America.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.875
This culminated yesterday
in a visit to TMZ

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.043
during which Kanye described
slavery as a choice.

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:13.846
Now, commenting on a black man's
opinions about slavery

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:16.282
is not something
I'm comfortable doing.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.483
-But I am!

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.419
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:26.292
-This is, um...

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.761
This is one of our writers,
Amber Ruffin.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:30.897
-Kanye, I'm sure you think

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.798
what you're doing right now
is fun.

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:38.437
But your words are being used as
fuel for the alt-right movement.

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:41.307
And my biggest concern
is your words will affect

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.443
how black children
see themselves!

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.712
You're telling them
that it is their fault

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.047
that they are at a disadvantage.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:50.283
So now I have no choice

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.019
but to counteract
all the harm you've done.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.653
-How are you going to do that?

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:57.357
-By speaking directly to
the hearts of young people

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:00.727
using the most powerful art form
known to man.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.328
Rap. Hit it!

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.163
[ '90s-style hip-hop beat
plays ]

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:06.332
-Amber!

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.469
Hey, Amber, are you even
good at rapping?

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:13.039
-No, I'm not.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.974
[ Audience clapping
rhythmically ]

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:18.411
Whoo!

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.980
A-come on, a-come on.
Please stop clapping.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.516
♪ African Americans' history ♪

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.618
♪ Should be a great source
of pride ♪

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:30.289
♪ Surviving the atrocity
of slavery to thrive ♪

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:34.860
♪ As part of a society
is something black people ♪

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.464
♪ Should all be proud of ♪

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.598
Hunh!

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.266
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:44.370
-Um, Amber, when is the last
time you heard a rap song?

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.239
-1990.
-Yeah.

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.940
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.743
Pretty sure they had rhymes
in 1990.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:54.647
-Seth, this is for the children!

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.716
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:58.251
Uh-huh-hunh!

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:02.822
♪ To imply that slaves had
a choice, minimizing slavery ♪

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:07.793
♪ And undercuts the strength
of the black community ♪

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:12.532
♪ Something that Kanye
used to be a part of ♪

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:13.766
Hunh!

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:19.371
[ Laughter ]
-So...

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:21.407
Amber, these are
very important points.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:23.476
But I just don't know if
this is the coolest way

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.977
to get those points across.

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:25.912
-Too late!

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:26.979
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:31.050
I've already committed!

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:35.488
♪ Kanye's scary comments
are a prime example ♪

00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:40.426
♪ Of what happens when
you have no black friends ♪

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:44.730
♪ You can't just repeat what
your rich white friends say ♪

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:49.669
♪ Your music may be fresh, but
your views on race are garbage ♪

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:50.703
Hunh!

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:53.539
[ Laughter, cheers,
and applause ]

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:56.142
-Give it up for Amber Ruffin,
everybody!

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:58.945
[ Cheers and applause ]

